      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "COMMON ERRORS:\n❌ Step 1b: LocationName doesn't exist → Invalid location\n❌ Step 1c: Partition not found → Name or AggregationName mismatch in DB\n❌ Step 2a: HEAppE unreachable or credentials invalid\n❌ Step 2b: No NodeType matches → Partition exists but no queue matches all 4 criteria",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "COMMON ERRORS:\n❌ Step 1b: LocationName doesn't exist → Invalid location\n❌ Step 1c: Partition not found → Name or AggregationName mismatch in DB\n❌ Step 2a: HEAppE unreachable or credentials invalid\n❌ Step 2b: No NodeType matches → Partition exists but no queue matches all 4 criteria",
